## Cross-service integration

| Channel | Usage in 1.4.0 |
|---------|------------------|
| **iframe** | Consumer opens `/upload-dialog`, `/selector`, `/viewer`, `/dialog` with `parentOrigin` + `scope` (+ `folderPath` where required) |
| **postMessage** | `webonone:media:init` (parent→iframe, JWT); `uploaded`, `select`, `viewer-changed`, `cancel` (iframe→parent) — never `'*'` |
| **JWT** | Verified locally in Media BE; token only via init message, never URL |
| **REST** | Consumer stores `media_id` + `url` from DTOs; no cross-service DB; no new backend endpoints |

Security additions: [08-media-consumer-integration.md#security-checklist-additions](./08-media-consumer-integration.md). Consumer validates scope + `folderPath` access before opening embed.

