## Risks and open items

| Risk / item | Mitigation |
|-------------|------------|
| Crop library bundle size | Lazy-load crop dialog; lightweight canvas cropper |
| Crop dialog height in embed | Use `flex-1` cropper + `disableContentScroll` to avoid scrollbar inside selector-sized dialog |
| Scoped nav edge cases | Unit test `useScopedNavigation`; normalize paths (`/` vs trailing slash) |
| Overlap with `/picker` | Document surface selection table in 08; keep `/picker` stable |
| Mobile iframe file input | Test iOS Safari + Android Chrome in Phase 2 |
| Viewer edit → selector UX | Decide inline overlay vs navigate to `/selector` with `returnTo=viewer` during Phase 4 |
| WebOnOne adoption target field | Pick hero/logo or gallery field during Phase 6 |

